msgctxt "[\"Zrythm\",\"User-Manual\",\"\",\"120981386\",\"8b996be15e417b43a8e7dce8\"]"
msgid "Zrythm will scan for plugins on startup and will remember those plugins until it is closed. Zrythm supports `CLAP`_, :term:`LV2`, :term:`VST2`, :term:`VST3`, :term:`LADSPA`, :term:`DSSI` and :term:`AU` plugins."
