# Review: de2e92390da146583c1a19e5
# Evidence: https://github.com/yeager/translations/blob/67e6d27877c9cfd6b6dbc74bd852b10bdbe09c3c/Zrythm/User-Manual/user-manual-sv-batch42-20260920.json
