msgctxt "[\"Zrythm\",\"User-Manual\",\"\",\"95830810\",\"e436bcd595ff48208f233dc4\"]"
msgid "However, Zrythm supports the JACK and RtAudio backends, which optionally support ASIO. As we cannot distribute these libraries with ASIO support along with Zrythm, you must obtain them yourself (for example by building them from source with ASIO support) and make Zrythm use those."
